  "body": "   For each interval expressed in the number lines, write the interval using set-builder notation.            Since all numbers less than or equal to are shaded, the set-builder notation is             Since all numbers less than to are shaded, the set-builder notation is             Since all numbers greater than or equal to are shaded, the set-builder notation is        "
