  "type": "Example",
  "number": "1.5.22",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  Solve the equation for .     Our variable is multiplied by the fraction . While we could divide on each side by , that leads to a messy four-level equation: . To avoid this, we can just multiply on each side by the reciprocal of .   We should check the solution by substituting in for : The solution is checked, and the solution set is .    "
