  "body": "   Serenity filled the gas tank in her car to When the tank reaches the low gas light will come on. On average, Serenity s car uses per mile driven. How many miles will Serenity s car be able to drive before the low gas light comes on? Write an equation to model this scenario. There is no need to solve it.            "
