  "type": "Exercise",
  "number": "1.8.6.43",
  "title": "",
  "body": "   You planted a young tree in front of your house, and it was feet tall. Ever since, it has been growing by each year. How many years will it take for the tree to grow to be 10 feet tall? Write an equation to model this scenario. There is no need to solve it.            "
