  "number": "3.10.42",
  "title": "",
  "body": "   A gym charges members for a registration fee, and then per month. You became a member some time ago, and now you have paid a total of to the gym. How many months have passed since you joined the gym?  months have passed since you joined the gym.        Let be the number of months since you became a member of the gym.  If you pay per month, you would pay dollars for months. In addition, you paid up front.  Now we can write an equation:   Next, we solve for :   months have passed since you joined the gym.       "
