  "type": "Warning",
  "number": "A.1.3",
  "title": "Subtraction Sign versus Negative Sign.",
  "body": " Subtraction Sign versus Negative Sign  Unfortunately, the symbol we use for subtraction looks just like the symbol we use for marking a negative number. We must be able to identify when a minus sign means to subtract and when it means to negate. Here are some examples.    has one negative sign and no subtraction sign.     has no negative signs and one subtraction sign.     has a negative sign and then a subtraction sign.     has two negative signs and no subtraction sign.     "
