  "body": "   Which of the following are whole numbers? There may be more than one correct answer.                             To be a whole number, you have to be one of the numbers . Sometimes whole numbers are explicitly written this way, and sometimes they are hidden. For example is a whole number, since . So the correct answers are BC.       "
